text = "Welcome to The Disco!

Let's Dance! Your job is to place the guests on the dance floor. But watch out: every dancer has their own moves!

Count Conga likes his dancers to finish in... well in a Conga. Your goal is to end the dance with a descending line of numbered dancers.

